==Strategy==
With eldritch horrors like 250% Cala Maria, 2400% Mistress Celeboodles, 600% Angelic Gories, 1200% Gabriels, and 3000% Star Pengs/Shibalien Elites, these stages take the concept of stages 1-10 and crank it up to the next level. Most of the threats however only spawn base hit, meaning you still are able to build up money. Make sure to pack plenty of meatshields and Ubers, or just about anything that consistently inhibits the enemies' raw strength, as their combined DPS can melt through even [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]] in the blink of an eye.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*Meatshields: There is a ridiculous amount of pushing power here, so make sure to run 4-5 meatshields. Good options here include [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Mohawk Cat]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]], [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi Cat]], Boulder Cat, and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]].
*[[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]]: Bubble Cat is an extremely effective attacker for these stages, since they work similarly to Housewife, except with Massive Damage to Angels and slightly higher range, which makes them even more effective than Mushroom Cat because they actually outrange Baron Seal.
*[[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom Cat]]: Given that the Angelic Gories are the hardest part of this level, you naturally will want units to kill them quickly. Packing Massive Damage vs Angels, Mushroom can outrange both Angelic Gory and Gabriel and quickly cripple them.
*Talented [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]: While not too helpful when Baron Seal is on the field, they help tremendously for building money up at the beginning of the stage, as well as dealing serious damage against the Shibalien Elites, Gabriels, Mistress Celeboodles, or Star Pengs.
*[[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]]: Works similarly to her performance on stages 1-10, having LD and being able to deal huge damage on the supporting threats with her Savage Blows.
*[[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]]: Cyberpunk is even more crucial here given how many threats are on screen at any present time. While many of the enemies here are slow, Gabriel and Angelic Gory are not, so make sure to protect Cyberpunk by ridding these two threats as fast as possible.
*Talented [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon Cat]]: A boosted LKD works great at supplying damage against Baron Seal. Also has an Attack combo with Jiangshi Cat.
*[[Urs & Fenrir (Special Cat)|Awakened Urs]]: Urs is a great generalist backliner, whose Colossus Slayer ability allows her to rack up huge DPS against Baron Seal as well as the supporting peons. While she is frail, she outranges most enemies here.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Momotaro (Uber Rare Cat)|The Peach Devils]]: Given how much sheer power is on screen, Peach Devils' Freeze is extremely strong here to reduce Angelic Gory and Baron Seal's pure force, if their Freeze activates.
*[[Empress Chronos (Uber Rare Cat)|Empress Chronos]]: Similarly to The Peach Devils, Chronos' Freeze is extremely powerful here to give a few seconds of relief.
*[[Kintaro (Uber Rare Cat)|Kinrangers GigaForce]]: Kintaro not only serves as a good support option for the Gories, but has LD and high piercing range to connect onto the threats present here. With talents, Kinrangers GigaForce can even target Red. Curse isn't too important given Baron Seal's DPS, but Slow definitely is.
*[[Shining Amaterasu (Uber Rare Cat)|Shining Amaterasu]]: Every enemy in these stages have a trait, allowing Amaterasu to deal massive amounts of damage to them all at her safe 455 range.
*Many [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] exclusives with the inclusion of a few [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] units, like [[Kasli the Bane (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasli the Bane]] and [[King of Doom Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|King of Doom Phono]]: Since all of the enemies here are traited, you can find great use for just about every UBERFEST exclusive here, with the only exception being [[Baby Garu (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Aegis Garu]] and [[Iz the Dancer (Uber Rare Cat)|Iz the Alluring Dancer]], as the stage is too aggressive for them to be of any use.
*Anti-Angel Ubers: The Angelic Gories are the hardest part of the level, so try to kill them quickly. Examples include [[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Jizo's Mega-Castle]], [[Mami Tomoe (Uber Rare Cat)|Mami Tomoe]], and [[Ushiwakamaru (Legend Rare Cat)|Colossal Benkei]].
*Anti-Red Nukers: Anti-Red Nukers have a chance to connect onto Baron Seal and potentially speed up the stage. Examples include [[Pai-Pai (Uber Rare Cat)|Pai-Pai DX]], [[EVA Unit-02 (Uber Rare Cat)|Unit-02, Code 777]], and [[Thundia (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Thundia β]].
*Colossus Slayer Ubers: Obviously, any Uber with Colossal Slayer gains much higher damage against Baron Seal, helping speed up these stages. In particular, [[Sea Serpent Daliasan (Uber Rare Cat)|God-Emperor Daliasan]], [[Goddess of Light Sirius (Uber Rare Cat)|Goddess of Sunrise Sirius]], [[Spectral Goth Vega (Uber Rare Cat)|Lady of Deception Vega]], [[Terun (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Terun ζ]], [[Lightmother Aset (Uber Rare Cat)|Almighty Aset]], and [[Cat Tengu (Uber Rare Cat)|Immortal Master Tengu]] are very strong here.
*[[Wonder MOMOCO (Legend Rare Cat)|Wonder MOMOCO]]: Very similar niche to Peach Devils trading survivability and cooldown for the ability to unleash high-level Waves to freeze Baron Seal and Cala Maria. She also gained Colossal Slayer and immunities to Baron Seal's debuff in True Form giving her even better matchup against it.
*[[Gaia the Creator (Legend Rare Cat)|Gaia the Creator]]: While a bit hard to use, Gaia's Insane Damage vs. Traited lets her deal extreme amounts of damage here when supported properly.
*[[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Supernova Cosmo]]: With his Colossal Slayer Talent unlocked, Supernova Cosmo can unleash crazy amounts of damage to every enemy here. Cosmo also has Freeze vs. Angels, which helps considerably against the Angelic Gories and Cala Maria, if she gets within range.
*[[Talents|Ultra Talented]] [[Wolfchild Deale (Uber Rare Cat)|Jester Queen Deale]]: With Mini-Waves, she can push all of Baron Seals support away from it, given she will knockback at least once. Colossus slayer also allows her to chip at Baron Seal as well.
